    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ode to Snow is a puzzle game with a Chinese fantasy theme. Players take on the role of Zhu You, a schoolgirl who must travel through the Temple of KongFuZi to save her friends in the mysterious Elf world and uncover its secrets, which span thousands of years.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features a distinctive art style, combining pixel art with traditional Chinese painting to provide players with a unique visual experience.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478110/extras/e9c504eb13c7d4efce8b303d71985bcb.poster.avif?t=1752486650\" width=400 height=236 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478110/extras/e9c504eb13c7d4efce8b303d71985bcb.webm?t=1752486650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478110/extras/e9c504eb13c7d4efce8b303d71985bcb.mp4?t=1752486650\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must solve puzzles, explore game mechanisms and collect broken pieces of a bronze mirror to find their way back to the real world. The clues to solving the puzzles reveal the love-hate relationship between two elves, and as you escape from the inner world, the past gradually comes to light.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478110/extras/58286d0d1690d73f06339d62da9d6ea5.poster.avif?t=1752486650\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478110/extras/58286d0d1690d73f06339d62da9d6ea5.webm?t=1752486650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478110/extras/58286d0d1690d73f06339d62da9d6ea5.mp4?t=1752486650\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478110/extras/15e5ce8ec3ea372afca64fe93641bccc.poster.avif?t=1752486650\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478110/extras/15e5ce8ec3ea372afca64fe93641bccc.webm?t=1752486650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478110/extras/15e5ce8ec3ea372afca64fe93641bccc.mp4?t=1752486650\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What is the connection between the Temple of KongFuZi in the real world and inner world? What kind of past is recorded in the white jade scroll? What secrets does your best friend hold? It's not just answers that can anwser the questions, but also love.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ode to Snow is a puzzle game with a Chinese fantasy theme. Players take on the role of Zhu You, a schoolgirl who must travel through the Temple of KongFuZi to save her friends in the mysterious Elf world and uncover its secrets, which span thousands of years.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features a distinctive art style, combining pixel art with traditional Chinese painting to provide players with a unique visual experience.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478110/extras/e9c504eb13c7d4efce8b303d71985bcb.poster.avif?t=1752486650\" width=400 height=236 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478110/extras/e9c504eb13c7d4efce8b303d71985bcb.webm?t=1752486650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478110/extras/e9c504eb13c7d4efce8b303d71985bcb.mp4?t=1752486650\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must solve puzzles, explore game mechanisms and collect broken pieces of a bronze mirror to find their way back to the real world. The clues to solving the puzzles reveal the love-hate relationship between two elves, and as you escape from the inner world, the past gradually comes to light.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478110/extras/58286d0d1690d73f06339d62da9d6ea5.poster.avif?t=1752486650\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478110/extras/58286d0d1690d73f06339d62da9d6ea5.webm?t=1752486650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478110/extras/58286d0d1690d73f06339d62da9d6ea5.mp4?t=1752486650\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478110/extras/15e5ce8ec3ea372afca64fe93641bccc.poster.avif?t=1752486650\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478110/extras/15e5ce8ec3ea372afca64fe93641bccc.webm?t=1752486650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478110/extras/15e5ce8ec3ea372afca64fe93641bccc.mp4?t=1752486650\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What is the connection between the Temple of KongFuZi in the real world and inner world? What kind of past is recorded in the white jade scroll? What secrets does your best friend hold? It's not just answers that can anwser the questions, but also love.</p>",
    "short_description": "This third-person puzzle RPG is set in a world ruled by elves. Your mission is to rescue your friend, unveil the secrets of the elves' bronze mirror and jade scroll, and record the enigmas you encounter in your notebook. To solve puzzles, you will explore the temple, use tools and talk to elves.",
